    "conclusion": "Only GlitchDog and LensDistortion have an explicit _Aspect uniform. The other five passes are aspect-unaware and stretch with the final image. LensDistortion uses manualAspect 1.6 (useScreenAspect 0) for this song. Bloom blur is texel-space via DualKawaseBlur."
